# Local agent controls, deliberately unpublished. This repo is public and the
# guardrail hook carries absolute home paths, the operator's repo-scope file and
# dated notes about a private system, none of which belong in a public tree. It
# protects the machine editing this library, not anyone installing it, so it is
# installed locally and ignored here. The private repos that carry the same hook
# commit it.
.claude/
